-- =============================================================================
-- mod-custom-ramvaris: Weather Data for game_weather table
--
-- Populates zone-based weather entries so the server's built-in weather system
-- produces rain/snow/storms in outdoor zones. Without this data, the Dark
-- Azeroth weather feature (CustomRamvaris.DarkAzeroth.Enable) works on login
-- and zone change via C++ forced weather, but the server's natural weather
-- timer has no base data to cycle through.
--
-- Uses REPLACE INTO — safe to run multiple times, overwrites existing rows.
-- =============================================================================

